<h2>1st LARAM Honour Lecture</h2>
<p style="text-align: justify;">Starting from 2018,&#160;The LARAM Honour Lecture is awarded for outstanding contributions in: i) scientific research on landslides and the related risk; and ii) educational activities dealing with landslide risk assessment and mitigation&#160;(<a href="laram_honour_lecture.html" target="_blank">link</a>).<br /><br />The 1st LARAM Honour Lecturer will be <strong><span style="text-decoration: underline;">Prof. Jordi Corominas</span></strong> (Universitat Polit&#232;cnica de Catalunya, UPC, Barcelona, SPAIN), September 2018.<br />.<br />Best Congratulations from the whole LARAM Staff and LARAM Community !!!<br />.</p></div>
